{
  "key": 54351,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_TakeARest",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a bed...\n",
        "Want to take a rest?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est un lit...\n",
        "Voulez-vous vous reposer?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_FellAsleep",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} quickly fell asleep\n",
        "in the bed...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} fait un somme...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_PokemonBecameFullyHealed",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} and the Pokémon\n",
        "became fully healed from the rest!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} et son équipe Pokémon\n",
        "sont en pleine forme!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_ReadReport",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a report titled “The Pokémon\n",
        "Statues of Eterna.”\r",
        "Would you like to read it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un rapport intitulé “Les Statues\n",
        "de Pokémon de Vestigion”.\r",
        "Voulez-vous le lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_PutReportBack",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put the report back.",
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} remet le rapport\n",
        "en place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_StatuePlateText1",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon statue plate text no. 1\n",
        "(from stolen plate):\r",
        "“{COLOR 2}The{COLOR 0} creation of DIA{COLOR 2}LGA,\n",
        "the{COLOR 0} giver of time...\r",
        "“In laughter, there is tears...\n",
        "And, likewise {COLOR 2}it is with time.{COLOR 0}\r",
        "“The same time flows {COLOR 2}on.{COLOR 0}\n",
        "{COLOR 2}For it is{COLOR 0} the blessing of DIA{COLOR 2}LGA.{COLOR 0}”\r",
        "The blue text has been extracted using\n",
        "a high-tech device made by the boss.\r",
        "Would you like to keep reading?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Premier texte de la statue de Pokémon\n",
        "(d’après la plaque volée)\r",
        "“{COLOR 2}La{COLOR 0} création de DIA{COLOR 2}LGA,\n",
        "le{COLOR 0} maître du temps...\r",
        "Dans le rire, il y a les larmes...\n",
        "Et, pareillement {COLOR 2}avec le temps.{COLOR 0}\r",
        "Le même temps s’écoule {COLOR 2}à jamais.{COLOR 0}\n",
        "{COLOR 2}Car c’est{COLOR 0} la bénédiction de DIA{COLOR 2}LGA.{COLOR 0}”\r",
        "Le texte en bleu a été reconstitué par\n",
        "le patron à l’aide de technologies\f",
        "ultrasophistiquées.\r",
        "Continuer à lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_StatuePlateText2",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon statue plate text no. 2\n",
        "(from stolen plate):\r",
        "“{COLOR 2}The{COLOR 0} birth of PAL{COLOR 2}KIA.{COLOR 0}\n",
        "{COLOR 2}The {COLOR 0}creator of parallel dimensions...\r",
        "“Alive, yet not alive...\n",
        "{COLOR 2}Everything d{COLOR 0}rifts in space...\r",
        "“To arrive in the same univer{COLOR 2}se.{COLOR 0}\n",
        "{COLOR 2}It is {COLOR 0}the blessing of PAL{COLOR 2}KIA.{COLOR 0}”\r",
        "The blue text has been extracted using\n",
        "a high-tech device made by the boss.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Deuxième texte de la statue de Pokémon\n",
        "(d’après la plaque volée)\r",
        "“{COLOR 2}La{COLOR 0} naissance de PAL{COLOR 2}KIA.{COLOR 0}\n",
        "{COLOR 2}Le {COLOR 0}créateur de dimensions parallèles...\r",
        "Vivant, et non-vivant...\n",
        "{COLOR 2}Tous les {COLOR 0}gouffres de l’espace...\r",
        "Arriver dans le même uni{COLOR 2}vers.{COLOR 0}\n",
        "{COLOR 2}Voilà {COLOR 0}la bénédiction de PAL{COLOR 2}KIA.{COLOR 0}”\r",
        "Le texte en bleu a été reconstitué par\n",
        "le patron à l’aide de technologies\f",
        "ultrasophistiquées.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_TeamGalacticNapRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic Nap Room\r",
        "Ensure the bed is unoccupied\n",
        "before getting into it!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salle de Repos de la Team Galaxie\r",
        "Vérifiez qu’un lit n’est pas occupé\n",
        "avant de sauter dedans!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_TeamGalacticTVRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic TV Room\r",
        "State-of-the-art audio & video\n",
        "system for member use only!\r",
        "Onward to a new universe!\n",
        "Team Galactic!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salle Télé de la Team Galaxie\r",
        "Installation hi-fi dernier cri\n",
        "réservée aux membres!\r",
        "En avant vers un nouvel univers!\n",
        "Team Galaxie!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_TeamGalacticCredo",
      "en_US": [
        "The Team Galactic credo!\n",
        "Everything belongs to Team Galactic!\r",
        "Look beyond the world--space will\n",
        "become Team Galactic’s!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le credo de la Team Galaxie?\n",
        "Tout appartient à la Team Galaxie!\r",
        "Nous n’avons que faire du monde...\n",
        "L’univers nous attend!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_KitchenSinkNotice",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a notice tacked on to\n",
        "the kitchen sink.\r",
        "“Health and prosperity through\n",
        "the partaking of favorite foods!”\r",
        "Foul, unidentifiable substances are\n",
        "caked around the sink..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un message est collé sur l’évier\n",
        "de la cuisine.\r",
        "“Partagez vos bons petits plats,\n",
        "cela amènera santé et bonne fortune!”\r",
        "Des substances visqueuses \n",
        "non identifiées bordent l’évier..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ2F_Text_RefrigeratorNotice",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a notice taped on to\n",
        "the refrigerator.\r",
        "“Drink all you wish and gain the\n",
        "energy to move us forward!”\r",
        "The refrigerator is filled with murky,\n",
        "sinister drinks and nothing else..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un message est collé sur \n",
        "le réfrigérateur.\r",
        "“Buvez jusqu’à plus soif\n",
        "pour avoir l’énergie d’avancer!”\r",
        "Le réfrigérateur ne contient que des\n",
        "boissons boueuses et sinistres..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}